				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-467788/scp-1193#post-4833949</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 01 Dec 2020 23:51:21 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>DeRockProject</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>486453</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>&quot;Notable parallels exist between information elicited via SCP-1193-02 and demonstrable facts about SCP-1193-01.&quot;</p> <p>It is &quot;confined&quot; doe to a &quot;restrained limb.&quot; Its &quot;arm&quot; is stuck in the drainage pipe, and the rest of the body is stuck in the planet Earth.</p> <p>Its &quot;cousin&quot; is coming &quot;soon&quot; to &quot;pick it up.&quot; The arm entity will be freed. By a similar entity.</p> <p>Oh.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
